{"id":"u-00b93848-462f-49f0-b269-689a8969a2a1","src":"community","title":"The Elite 5-Day Physique Program)","author":"Hari","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/JwblfI-elite5dayphysiqueprogramboostcamp-1-1","desc":"A structured 5-day strength and hypertrophy program designed to build a powerful, lean, muscular, and athletic physique.\n\nCombining heavy compound lifts, targeted muscle-building exercises, and functional core training, this program develops full-body strength, muscle size, and athletic performance without unnecessary training volume.\n\nWHAT TO EXPECT\n5 training days per week — a balanced upper/lower and push/pull/legs structure.\n\nStrength development — focus on major compound movements with progressive overload.\n\nMuscle hypertrophy — targeted training to build a broad chest, strong back, powerful legs, and muscular shoulders and arms.\n\nCore and stability — dedicated exercises to improve trunk strength and control.\n\nAthletic conditioning — loaded carries and rotational movements to build practical strength.\n\nProgressive overload — a clear double-progression approach to increase reps and weight over time.\n\nTHE GOAL\n\nBuild a strong, lean, muscular physique with the presence of an athlete—not simply the size of a bodybuilder.\n\nRECOMMENDED DURATION: 8–12 weeks\n\nTRAINING FREQUENCY: 5 days per week\n\nTRAINING STYLE: Strength + Hypertrophy + Athletic Core","level":["Advanced","Intermediate"],"goals":["Athletics","Strength","Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":90,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-25T11:35:12.286Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Upper Strength + Core","Lower Strength + Core","Push Hypertrophy + Core","Pull Hypertrophy + Core","Legs Hypertrophy + Athletic Core"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":4,"hi":6,"x":3}]},{"n":"Barbell Row","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"x":3}],"note":"Use assistance as needed to main